{
  "title": "Transiciones entre cámaras",
  "uid": "transiciones",
  "description": "Mismo objeto visto por dos cámaras, tabla `deepfrigate.camera_transitions`. `gap_seconds` NO es tiempo de viaje: `cooccurrence` empareja por solape, así que sale negativo cuando el objeto se vio en las dos a la vez. La base se recreó el 7 sep 23:08 sin conservar histórico.",
  "tags": [
    "deepfrigate",
    "transiciones"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Resumen",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Transiciones",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT count(*) AS \"transiciones\"\n  FROM deepfrigate.camera_transitions\n WHERE $__timeFilter(created_at)\n   AND ('$label' = 'todas' OR label = '$label')\n"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Por hora",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT round(count(*) / nullif(extract(epoch from\n         (max(created_at) - min(created_at))) / 3600, 0)::numeric, 1)\n         AS \"por hora\"\n  FROM deepfrigate.camera_transitions\n WHERE $__timeFilter(created_at)\n   AND ('$label' = 'todas' OR label = '$label')\n"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Solape (gap < 0)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT round(100.0 * count(*) FILTER (WHERE gap_seconds < 0)\n             / nullif(count(*), 0), 1) AS \"% solape\"\n  FROM deepfrigate.camera_transitions\n WHERE $__timeFilter(created_at)\n   AND ('$label' = 'todas' OR label = '$label')\n"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Porcentaje de emparejamientos en los que el objeto se vio en las DOS cámaras a la vez. No es un error: `cooccurrence` empareja por solape. Medido el 8 sep: 10 de 19."
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Última hace",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT round(extract(epoch from now() - max(created_at)) / 60)\n         AS \"minutos\"\n  FROM deepfrigate.camera_transitions\n WHERE $__timeFilter(created_at)\n   AND ('$label' = 'todas' OR label = '$label')\n"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {},
          "unit": "m",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "Minutos desde el último emparejamiento. Sirve para ver si el matcher sigue vivo: sin alerta de cámara caída, esto es lo único que lo delata."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Matriz y ritmo",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Matriz origen → destino",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT from_camera AS \"desde\", to_camera AS \"hacia\",\n       label AS \"etiqueta\", count(*) AS \"n\",\n       round(percentile_cont(0.5) WITHIN GROUP\n             (ORDER BY gap_seconds)::numeric, 1) AS \"desfase p50 (s)\",\n       max(candidates) AS \"máx candidatos\"\n  FROM deepfrigate.camera_transitions\n WHERE $__timeFilter(created_at)\n   AND ('$label' = 'todas' OR label = '$label')\n GROUP BY 1, 2, 3 ORDER BY 4 DESC"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "filterable": true,
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "El sentido dominante difiere por etiqueta: los peatones cruzan en un sentido y los coches circulan en el otro."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Transiciones por hora",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
          },
          "format": "time_series",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT date_trunc('hour', created_at) AS time,\n       label AS metric, count(*) AS value\n  FROM deepfrigate.camera_transitions\n WHERE $__timeFilter(created_at)\n   AND ('$label' = 'todas' OR label = '$label')\n GROUP BY 1, 2 ORDER BY 1"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        },
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "axisBorderShow": false
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Desfase entre cámaras (no es tiempo de viaje)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Distribución del desfase",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT bucket AS \"desfase (s)\",\n       count(*) FILTER (WHERE gap_seconds <  0) AS \"solape\",\n       count(*) FILTER (WHERE gap_seconds >= 0) AS \"tránsito\"\n  FROM (SELECT gap_seconds,\n               (floor(gap_seconds / 5) * 5)::int AS bucket\n          FROM deepfrigate.camera_transitions\n         WHERE $__timeFilter(created_at)\n           AND ('$label' = 'todas' OR label = '$label')\n       ) b\n GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "orientation": "auto",
        "showValue": "auto",
        "xTickLabelRotation": 0,
        "barWidth": 0.8,
        "stacking": "normal",
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "fillOpacity": 85
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "solape"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "tránsito"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "description": "Partido en el cero a propósito. **`gap_seconds` no es tiempo de viaje.** Negativo = el objeto apareció en la segunda cámara antes de terminar en la primera, o sea que se vio en las dos a la vez. Mezclarlos en una sola distribución esconde que son dos fenómenos distintos. Bucket de 5 s."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Detalle",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Emparejamientos, con enlace a Explore",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 14
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "frigate-smoke-pg"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT created_at AS \"cuándo\", label AS \"etiqueta\",\n       from_camera AS \"desde\", to_camera AS \"hacia\",\n       round(gap_seconds::numeric, 1) AS \"desfase (s)\",\n       candidates AS \"candidatos\", method AS \"método\",\n       from_frigate_event_id AS \"id desde\",\n       to_frigate_event_id   AS \"id hacia\",\n       '/api/datasources/proxy/uid/deepfrigate-platform-api/v1/events/' || from_frigate_event_id\n         || '/thumbnail.jpg' AS \"foto desde\",\n       '/api/datasources/proxy/uid/deepfrigate-platform-api/v1/events/' || to_frigate_event_id\n         || '/thumbnail.jpg' AS \"foto hacia\",\n       'https://100.83.231.97:3005/explore?event_id=' || from_frigate_event_id AS \"ver desde\",\n       'https://100.83.231.97:3005/explore?event_id=' || to_frigate_event_id   AS \"ver hacia\"\n  FROM deepfrigate.camera_transitions\n WHERE $__timeFilter(created_at)\n   AND ('$label' = 'todas' OR label = '$label')\n ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 100"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "lg",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "filterable": true,
            "align": "auto"
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Ver este par abajo",
              "url": "/d/transiciones/transiciones-entre-camaras?${__url_time_range}&var-label=${label}&var-from_event=${__data.fields[\"id desde\"]}&var-to_event=${__data.fields[\"id hacia\"]}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "id desde"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.hidden",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "id hacia"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.hidden",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "foto desde"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "image"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 150
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "foto hacia"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "image"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 150
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "ver desde"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "link",
                  "urlText": "abrir"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 70
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "ver hacia"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "link",
                  "urlText": "abrir"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 70
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "description": "Las dos fotos son las miniaturas de cada Event: si no son el mismo objeto, el emparejamiento es falso y se ve de un vistazo. Van por el proxy de Grafana porque Frigate corre con auth y devuelve 401 al navegador. Los enlaces abren Explore, que es donde se comprueba a fondo. `score` va NULL salvo que hubiera empate y se desempatara con embedding: no usar `avg(score)` como calidad."
    },
